      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# RMBG-2.0 dependency\n\nThis workflow removes the background before reconstruction so TRELLIS.2 does not turn the backdrop into geometry.\n\n1. Accept BRIA's gated non-commercial access terms and download the four required files from [briaai/RMBG-2.0](https://huggingface.co/briaai/RMBG-2.0).\n2. Place `BiRefNet_config.py`, `birefnet.py`, `config.json`, and `model.safetensors` in `ComfyUI/models/RMBG/RMBG-2.0/`.\n3. Restart ComfyUI after installing the files.\n\nThe workflow also embeds official download metadata on the RMBG node. ComfyUI may still require browser authentication because the repository is gated. CFP does not bundle or mirror these weights. Commercial use requires a separate agreement with BRIA.\n\nThe CFP Input Mask Quality Gate inspects RMBG alpha before inference. Its separate MASK input is intentionally unused here because RMBG mask polarity differs; the gate derives standard ComfyUI transparency semantics from the RGBA alpha channel."
      ],
      "color": "#493b1f",
      "bgcolor": "#6a5730",
      "title": "RMBG-2.0 — Download, Purpose, and License"
    },
